{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌸*･"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♫ そう懐かしいスマホの写真を見ながらふと思った"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋﹋"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふと思った。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そう、ふと思い出した。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『桜橋が教えてくれた』MVのオフショットブログ、ちょ、さすがにあたためすぎたのでは……ということを。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41枚目シングルに収録されている6期生楽曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『桜橋が教えてくれた』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同期の愛宕心響ちゃんがセンターを務めています🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しっかり者だけどいつも一緒にいて面白くて笑顔が可愛いここねん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/TNHVgK7HLfY?si=3rlofWhsgE8ERrX1"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このMV、最高に儚可愛い。最高。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｺｰﾅｰ【教えて！桜橋っ！！】"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "のんちゃん(大越)とみーさん(瀬戸口)のふたりとは、撮影の日のスケジュールが似ていて、結構ずーっとずっと一緒にいました^^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっとした空き時間があったので、2人と共に辺りを散策していたんですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は楽屋があった施設の中に、市場とクレーンゲームがあったんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これを見た私たち一同、当たり前に大歓喜の大はしゃぎでございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しかもしかも、なんてこと…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あの大きい透明の箱(クレーンゲーム)の中に、大きいマグロのぬいぐるみを見つけてしまったんですよ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（私は動物のグッズに目がない）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうしてもほしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けどね、私人生でクレーンゲームをほとんどやったことがないんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゲームセンターの店舗(？)みたいなのに行ったことがなかったので…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つまり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "超がつくほどのクレーンゲーム初心者なわけで。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "矢田萌華、弱すぎる。アームと格闘。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "👾💜👾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobbWaUdk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、やりましたよ！！\nついにゲットしました！わーい( ˶'ᵕ'˶ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで今、わたしのうちのソファにマグロがいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "名前は見ての通り「鯖太郎」です。\n「太郎」か「太朗」かは検討中です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、鯖タロウはれっきとしたマグロです🐟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "分かりにくいけどタイタニックごっこ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わちゃわちゃ、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobRxWcnn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "のんちゃんが良い感じのカメラを買ったと言うので撮ってもらったのだけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なるほど…確かに。質感が全く違う。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりに玲奈とも一緒の撮影ができたし、とにかく楽しい撮影でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さて、そろそろ、橋を渡りましょうか。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41 ┈┈┈┈┈🌸┈┈┈┈ 42"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "42枚目シングル"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回のシングルで6期生はまたひとつ、素敵な楽曲をいただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『命の色』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/xpruiYFMF_g?si=S5772Y1WfTCc2rQd"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この曲では、長嶋凛桜ちゃんがセンターを務めています❀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りおがこの曲のセンターでよかったって、心からそう思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生みんなでの宝物がまたひとつ増えたことも、本当に嬉しい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あつくて、つかれちゃって、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mob2WNfPf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ねた。\nお仕事のの空き時間、はじめて寝た。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobLIWBMt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "爽やかな夏を背負ってみた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう季節は夏。\n桜は散ってしまったけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "凛桜と私たち6期生が届けるこの曲を聴いたみんなの心に、満開の桜を咲かせられますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この楽曲に込めた気持ちは、\n毎月27日に秋田魁新報さんで連載している"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『わたしの居場所』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.sakigake.jp/news/article/20260820AK0038/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここでお話させていただいています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらも是非、ご覧ください。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "へば、またな🌸🌻"}], "source": "official"}